  "content": {
    "text": "5 hours ago\nElon Musk appears after SpaceX’s public debut to have become the world’s first trillionaire. Here’s the math.\nNow that SpaceX's stock is officially trading, it's possible to calculate how much it's adding to Elon Musk's net worth.\nHe owns 6.42 billion SpaceX shares, including 849.5 million of the Class A shares that just started trading. With the stock trading at $172.15, the value of his shares has increased by $238.45 billion since the $135 pricing of the IPO was announced less than 24 hours ago.\nHe also owns 717.1 million Tesla shares, according to an April ownership filing, and those are up 0.3% on Friday, to add $745.8 million to his wealth.",
